 Triumph Towers. \nTriumph Towers Price Rs. 2.40 Cr - 3.52 Cr\nProperty Types Flat\nProject Type Residential\nTriumph Towers Status Ready To Move\nTriumph Towers Launch Date 01 December 2018\nTriumph Towers Possession Date 01 May 2024\nTowers in Triumph Towers 2\n Strategically located in Malad West, Mumbai, Triumph Towers offers property options within the price range of Rs. 2.40 Cr - 3.52 Cr. Triumph Towers has been developed by the well-known builder Triumph Builders LLP. The project is currently at the Ready To Move stage. It is spread over an area of 2 Acre. The project offers a total of 153 units.\n\nThe project consists of 2 towers. The official launch date for the project was December 2018.The commencement certificate of Triumph Towers has been granted. Next to Durgadevi Saraf College, Near MTNL Junction, S. V. Road, Malad (W), Mumbai is the official address of this project. The project is located at one of the most sought after pin codes that is 400095. If financed through a home loan, you can expect an EMI of nearly Rs. 1.2 Lac/month over 30 years. At the moment, 9 properties are on sale via owners and dealers, offering multiple options to explore. Chandak Treesourus, Narang Vivenda, Mahindra Marina64, Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara, Ruparel Stardom are key nearby under-construction projects. Nearby options include Transcon Auris Serenity, Raj Infinia, K Raheja Interface Heights, Gurukrupa Marina Enclave, Transcon & Sheth Auris Bliss, all of which are ready-to-move societies.\n\n### Triumph Towers Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Triumph Towers 2 BHK Flat | 765 Sq. Ft. |\n| Triumph Towers 3 BHK Flat | 1125 Sq. Ft. |\n Floor plans tell you exactly how big or small the rooms or spaces in a house are, and so are the perfect way to get an understanding of the house layoutAt Triumph Towers, you are offered as many as 2 configuration, available in 2 types of floor plans. Well spaced out balconies and bathrooms with latest fittings pro