on, S.V. Road, Malad (W), Mumbai, 400095.\n\n### How many units are in Triumph Towers?\n\nTriumph Towers has a total of 153 units. These units are located in 2 towers, with each tower offering a mix of 2,3 BHK Flats.\n\n### What is the price of 3 BHK in Triumph Towers, Mumbai?\n\nAt Triumph Towers, the sale price of 3 BHK varies from ₹ 2.95 Cr - 3.90 Cr.\n\n### What is the price of 2 BHK in Triumph Towers, Mumbai?\n\nAt Triumph Towers, a 2 BHK can be bought at an affordable cost of ₹ 2.45 Cr - 2.48 Cr.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 08 September 2026 i View Details\n\nLast Updated Details\n\n*   2 Sale Property 'Posted on Sep 6, 2026'\n*   15 New Property Photos 'Posted on Sep 6, 2026'\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n*   [2 BHK Flats for Sale in Triumph Towers](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-triumph-towers-2bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [3 BHK Flats for Sale in Triumph Towers](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-triumph-towers-3bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Flats for Sale in Triumph Towers](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-triumph-towers-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nQuick Links\n\n*   [Triumph Towers Amenities](https://www.magicbricks.com/triumph-towers-amenities-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235323532353131)\n*   [Triumph Towers Photos Videos](https://www.magicbricks.com/triumph-towers-photo-videos-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235323532353131)\n*   [Triumph Towers Brochure](https://www.magicbricks.com/triumph-towers-brochure-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235323532353131)\n*   [Triumph Towers Floor Plan](https://www.magicbricks.com/triumph-towers-floor-plan-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235323532353131)\n*   [Triumph Towers Reviews](https://www.magicbricks.com/triumph-towers-reviews-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235323532353131)\n*   [Triumph Towers Location](https://www.magicbricks.com/triumph-towers-location-malad-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235323532353131)\n\nView More\n\nNew Launched Projects\n\n*   [Codename Triumph Tower 1](https://www.magicbri