ad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064\n\nMalad West\n\n₹1.93 Cr - 2.84 Cr\n\n₹1.93 Cr - 2.84 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nIntroducing Triumph Tower, a stunning development with thoughtfully planned living spaces that feature well-designed apartments at affordable prices. With its remarkable apartments in Malad, Triumph Tower offers a lifestyle fit for royalty. Triumph Tower allows you to forget that you live in the heart of the city, making your home the perfect retreat after a long day at work. These residential apartments in Malad provide luxurious residences that seamlessly escape the city center's noise. Additionally, living in apartments in a prime location offers a range of advantages. Triumph Tower is ideally situated in Malad, providing unparalleled connectivity to all major landmarks and essential services, including numerous reputable medical facilities, schools, supermarkets, parks, entertainment venues, recreational centers, and more.\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Jun 2023\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹25,228/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n765 - 1125 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Connected to trains via Malad Railway Station on the Mumbai Suburban Railway's Western Line\n* Connected to Manori, Gorai, and Versova through ferries\n* There are many hospitals here, including Lifeline Multispeciality Hospital, Zenith Hospital, and Saraswati Hospital.\n* Popular tourist attractions in the area include Sanjay Gandhi National Park, Marve Beach, and Ashtavinayak Temple.\n\n* Being close to the Western Express Highway provides quick access to places like Kandivali, Borivali East, and Aarey.\n* Where renowned educational institutions like Ryan International School, Witty International School, and Rejoice International School are located\n* Numerous shopping malls, including as Evershine Mall, Infiniti Mall, and Inorbit Mall, are located in Malad (West).\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nGoogle reviews for Triumph Towers in Malad West indicate a generally positive reception, particularly regarding its upscale positioning and location. Residents and owners frequently describe it as a luxury-focused project with high-quality construction and \"hotel-like\" interiors. While many reviews highlight the lifestyle amenities and panoramic views, some feedback comes from professional brokers rather than solely long-term residents.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nPrime Location\n\nSituated on S.V. Road near MTNL Junction, offering excellent connectivity to Malad and Goregaon railway stations.\n\nHigh-Quality Construction\n\nMultiple reviews praise the \"exquisite craftsmanship,\" \"stunning architecture,\" and \"strong walls and pillars.\"\n\nModern Amenities\n\nIncludes a wide range of facilities such as a swimming pool, rooftop skydeck, gym, library, and dedicated sports areas (cricket pitch, football field).\n\nSpacious Layouts\n\nApartments are noted for having large bedrooms, well-ventilated spaces, and servant toilets on every floor.\n\nAccessibility\n\nEasy availability of public transport, including autos and cabs, right outside the complex.\n\nProximity to Institutions\n\nLocated very close to Durgadevi Saraf College and reputed schools like Orchid International.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nPremium Pricing\n\nProperty rates are significantly higher than the average asking price for Malad West, which may deter budget-conscious buyers.\n\nLimited Feedback\n\nThe volume of organic, long-term resident reviews on Google is relatively low compared to other major projects in the area.\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nBeing located on S.V. Road means residents often face heavy traffic and noise during peak hours.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nIdeal for Luxury Seekers\n\nStrong Investment Potential\n\nReady-to-Move Reliability\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Library-And-Business-Centre-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Library-And-Business-Centre-secondary.svg)\n\nLibrary And Business Centre\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/snooker-pool-billiards-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/snooker-pool-billiards-secondary.svg)\n\nSnooker / Billiards\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-secondary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/table-tennis-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/table-tennis-secondary.svg)\n\nTable Tennis\n\nView all 13 amenities\n\n![arrow-down-grey](/assets/icons/arrow-down-grey.svg)\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-primary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Library-And-Business-Centre-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Library-And-Business-Centre-primary.svg)\n\nLibrary And Business Centre\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/snooker-pool-billiards-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/snooker-pool-billiards-primary.svg)\n\nSnooker / Billiards\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-primary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/table-tennis-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/table-tennis-primary.svg)\n\nTable Tennis\n\nView All 13 Amenities\n\n![arrow-next-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-next-primary.svg)\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK\n\n3 BHK\n\n* ## 765 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n2 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹1.93 Cr\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/triumph-ventures-triumph-towers-2-bhk-bedroom-1673195746.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![school-primary](/assets/icons/school-primary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![hospital-secondary](/assets/icons/hospital-secondary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nSt Mary'S English School\n\n0.2 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nKudilal Govindram Seksaria Sarvodaya School\n\n0.2 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nJ Kumar International School\n\n0.2 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nUmedbhai Patel English School\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nWitty International School, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\nInfant Jesus School\n\n0.5 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹2,01,674per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹2,42,00,924\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nTriumph Towersis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800027364](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800027364)\n\nTriumph Towers\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Triumph Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Triumph Towers is 30 Jun 2023\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Triumph Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Triumph Towers is 765 - 1125 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Triumph Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Triumph Towers is ₹1.93 Cr - 2.84 Cr\n\n### Where is Triumph Towers located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nTriumph Towers is located at Triumph Towers ,Bajaj Hall, Swami Vivekananda Rd, Malad, Pawan Baug, Liliya Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064.\n\n### What configurations are available in Triumph Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nTriumph Towers has 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Triumph Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Triumph Towers is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Triumph Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Intercom Facility, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Library And Business Centre, Multipurpose Hall, Snooker / Billiards, Swimming Pool, Table Tennis, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Triumph Towers?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Triumph Towers is Triumph Ventures.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Triumph Towers:Triumph Ventures](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/100522113411-triumphven.png)\n\n## Triumph Ventures\n\nTriumph Ventures is the brainchild of Mr. Rajiv Anant Shah, who is part of the Chintamani Group, a diversified conglomerate with interests in real estate, textiles and film studios. Over the years the group has developed various residential and commercial properties across the city in Zaveri Bazar, Mahim, Andheri and Goregaon. Mr. Shah carries with himself almost 2 decades of experience in Real Estate. He has been actively involved in every stage of these projects, right from identifying potential development to its acquisition, its planning, execution and completion till the final handover. Triumph Ventures are also redeveloping the adjoining society plot under the name “Omkareshwar”. Both projects combined are all set to change the look and skyline of Rajendra Nagar and the lifestyle of the residents with their design and modern amenities. Triumph Group envisages to create projects of impeccable quality and efficient design which would add value to the lifestyle of a buyer.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/polo-infra-developers-polo-matrix-elevation-1788606318.webp)\n\n![Polo Matrix](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/031023045019-newproject-22.webp)\n\nPolo Matrix\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.62 Cr - 2.33 Cr\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/hs-group-downtown-liberty-one-elevation-1788604964.webp)\n\n![Downtown Liberty One](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/220122014710-2.png)\n\nDowntown Liberty One\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹2.04 Cr\n\n2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/urjha-realty-urjha-liberty-heights-elevation-1783081173.webp)\n\n![Urjha Liberty Heights](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/030726050801-images-15-1.webp)\n\nUrjha Liberty Heights\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.31 Cr - 2.18 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-realty-runwal-auris-elevation-1770099228.jpg)\n\n![Runwal Auris](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/281025123533-blob624ee0f6-1d0a-4d57-a063-52f1ef0e53bf.webp)\n\nRunwal Auris\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹5.07 Cr - 7.8 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper.svg)\n\n![arrow-right-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-right-swiper.svg)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/pranav-constructions-pvt-ltd-pcpl-falcon-crest-1748261738.jpg)\n\n![PCPL Falcon Crest](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/270922062701-newproject-85.jpg)\n\nPCPL Falcon Crest\n\nMalad W